      "Anchor": "parameters",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Search for Companies",
        "Parameters"
      ],
      "Text": "You should search for only a single company at a time. All search parameters should be related to the single company you intend to find.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Search by Keywords",
      "Anchor": "search-by-keywords",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Search by Keywords"
      ],
      "Text": "Use query to search companies by keywords.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Sample Request",
      "Anchor": "sample-request-1",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Search by Keywords",
        "Sample Request"
      ],
      "Text": "http\n\n\ncurl",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "Sample Request",
      "Anchor": "sample-request-1",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Search by Keywords",
        "Sample Request"
      ],
      "Text": "GET https://api.linkedin.com/v2/companySearch?q=search\u0026query=LinkedIn%20Corporation",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "Sample Request",
      "Anchor": "sample-request-1",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Search by Keywords",
        "Sample Request"
      ],
      "Text": "curl -X GET \u0027https://api.linkedin.com/v2/companySearch?q=search\u0026query=LinkedIn%20Corporation\u0027 \\\n-H \u0027Authorization: Bearer {INSERT_TOKEN}\u0027 \\\n-H \u0027X-Restli-Protocol-Version: 2.0.0\u0027 \\\n-H \u0027Linkedin-Version: {version number in the format YYYYMM}\u0027 \\\n-H \u0027Content-Type: application/json\u0027",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Search by Filters",
      "Anchor": "search-by-filters",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Search by Filters"
      ],
      "Text": "Use the filter parameters to search by one or more facets. Each filter may contain multiple values, so use bracket array notation, and be sure to URL-encode the brackets (note encoded brackets %5B0 and %5BD in the request below).",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Sample Request",
      "Anchor": "sample-request-2",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Search by Filters",
        "Sample Request"
      ],
      "Text": "http\n\n\ncurl",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
